Z||000013||dogtired||11-17-1999||10:47 AM||||Man I have too much time on my hands  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>DON'T TRY THIS AT HOME!<BR>OK also saw on the Discovery Channel, large vehicles crossing the polar caps, in subZero temperatures. They had a flat tire, pulled the tire off the rim repaired it and had a problem in reseating the bead when they put it back on the rim. So they layed the tire and wheel on the ground, pulled the wheel up to start the bottom bead to seal then poured lighter fluid all around the upper bead, stood back and threw matches at it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> They didn't let it burn just wanted the initial flash! Because of the extreem differences in temperature of the weather (subzero), and the flash of the lighter fluid (heat) the space inside the tire expanded enough (quickly) to pop it back on the rim. Surely someone else saw this? I dont just dream this stuff up! I watch too much TV. Isn't this the wrong forum for this stuff, maybe should be labeled Strange and Wierd  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> like me! Quick somebody hand me a Coke.||||reg||12
Z||000014||fiero56||11-17-1999||12:10 PM||||I had forgotten about that one.  But now that I hear it, I  remember watching that episode.  I thought it was pretty cool. As I remember, the air in the tire would expand from the flash of heat and seal the bead. I thought it that was clever, can't believe I forgot about it. ||||reg||14
Z||000015||dogtired||11-18-1999||02:19 PM||||I herd that if you take Moth Balls (man those little critters are hard to cath) and sprinkle them around the outside of your house that it will keep CATs away? (Cats - the other white meat!)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <BR>I know it didn't have anything to do with cars but you might spread them around your fiero so mice can get in?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>Am I the only one that knows this worthless type of info?<BR>If I ever have a car to sell I will have to change my name because of some of the things I have said above.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||10
